            "text": "<p>To maintain a fair and successful program, we have a few essential guidelines:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Country of Residence:</strong> Our affiliate program is open for US-based residents only, at the moment.</li><li><strong>Payment Processing:</strong> All affiliates must have a valid PayPal account for receiving payouts.</li><li><strong>Tax Information:</strong> Affiliates must provide a Social Security Number (SSN) or Taxpayer ID Number (TIN).</li><li><strong>No Self-Referrals:</strong> You may not earn commissions on purchases made by yourself.</li><li><strong>Ethical Marketing:</strong> Spamming, misleading promotions, or any fraudulent activity will result in disqualification and forfeiture of earned commissions.</li><li><strong>Program Integrity:</strong> Any attempts to manipulate or circumvent tracking will lead to immediate account termination and the voiding of all commissions.<br/><br/></li></ul>",
